{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"阿摩司书","commonName":"阿摩司书","title":"阿摩司书","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"aea65afe0e5862ee36486d1d8f71c20a1bc4c3aa5415828aa0c58b4c80057d03","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["审判之日将临"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["这是主耶和华让我看见的异象：看啊，一篮夏天的果子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶和华问我：“阿摩司，你看见什么？”我说：“我看见一篮夏天的果子。”祂说：“我以色列子民的结局",{"noteId":5},"到了，我不会再饶恕他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["到那日，宫殿里的歌声要变成哀号；尸横遍地，一片死寂。这是主耶和华说的。”"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"践踏贫民、灭绝穷人的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要听！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们盼望朔日","poem":1},{"noteId":6},{"text":"和安息日快点过去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们好售卖谷物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们用小升斗卖粮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用加重的砝码收银子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用诡诈的秤欺骗人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们用银子买贫民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以一双鞋买穷人为奴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"售卖掺了糠秕的麦子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和华凭雅各的骄傲起誓：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我决不会忘记你们的所作所为。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这片土地要因此而震动，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有的居民都要悲哀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地要像尼罗河一样涨起，如埃及的河流翻腾退落。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“到那日，我要使太阳中午落下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使大地在白天一片黑暗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使你们的节期变为丧礼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫你们的欢歌变为哀歌。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使你们都腰束麻布，剃光头发；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使你们伤心欲绝，如丧独生子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使那日成为痛苦的日子。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“日子将到，我要使饥荒降在地上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人饥饿非因无饼，干渴非因无水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而是因为听不到耶和华的话。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人们从南到北，从东到西","poem":1},{"noteId":7},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在境内四处奔走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要寻找耶和华的话却找不到。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["“到那日，",{"text":"“美丽少女和青春少男都要因干渴而昏倒；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些凭撒玛利亚、但和别示巴的神明起誓的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都要跌倒，永不再起来。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"“结局”希伯来文中与“夏天的果子”发音相近。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":2}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"“朔日”即每月初一。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":5}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"“从南到北，从东到西”希伯来文是“从这海到那海，从北到东”。海指西面的地中海和南面的死海。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}